     "title": "Welcome to the Endocrine System",
     "content": "Your body runs on two communication networks. One is electrical and lightning-fast (the nervous system). The other is chemical and works slowly across your whole body: the endocrine system. In this book we explore how tiny chemical messengers called hormones quietly control your growth, mood, energy, and much more.",
